         {
          "marks": [],
          "type": "math_inline",
          "attrs": {
           "latex": "R"
          }
         },
         {
          "marks": [],
          "type": "text",
          "text": "²: the mean incident intensity is 600 / 4 = 150 W m⁻². The absorbed fraction is 1 − 0.30 = 0.70. Mean absorbed intensity = 150 × 0.70 = 105 W m⁻²."
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
